<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">Gala - Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">Galaatiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosa Galaatiya Asayis Xaafeez Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galaatiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosa Galaatiya Asayis Xaafeez Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesuusa ashshizaya maaqqeezana odiza Wonggile qaalay duma duma aqo sabbakinttin, Ayihude baa asitay ammanttar ammanttar yhammadar «Kiristtaane maaqqodayis Muse higge polodayis koshshinenee koshshoosa?» yeegii woli oyiceeza. Ye wode Phawuloosa, «Kiristtaanee maaqqoayis Muse higge polodayis koshshooya; Yesuusar orothi de7o denggodayis koshshizay ammano. Asay Xooss tiina xillodayis danda7izay ammano aaddara» yeegii taamarsseeza. Zin Xiqqa Iisiya gancce, Galata awurajja yez woosa keetha yez asay gancce, «Asii Xooss tiina xillodayis Yesuusana ammano aadda baazin Muse higgakka polodayis koshshiza» yeegii Phawuloosa timirttana ixxiza asitay yeza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosa Galata maxaafe xaafeezay, ye buuta timirttayir balintteez asa tuma ammanayikonnee ammanor yessiko mahodayisii. Phawuloosa Yesuusa hawaare maaqqizana tillisii odo aykkeeza. Eza hawaare udii xeegeezay as baazin Xooss maaqqeezanannee E kiitintteezay Ayihude baa asayis maaqqeezana paaddii odeeza. Yeyir ayisithii asay Xooss tiina xillodayis danda7izay ammanor aadda maaqqizana odiza. Wurssithii shemppitay ammanor yessay Yesuusa ammanor benttiz siiqopp keziza maaqqizana odiza.</para>
  <para style="iot">Galaatiya kiitay akkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 1:1-10">1:1-10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosa hawaaretith mawute <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 1:11-2:21">1:11—2:21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xooss aadho keehetith Wonggile <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 3:1-4:31">3:1—4:31</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wallotithinnee ammanor yessi <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 5:1-6:10">5:1—6:10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kustte qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 6:11-18">6:11-18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1"/>Asapp woy as baggar baazin Yesuus Kiristtoosapp eza yhayiqopp dentheez Xooss Adaypp hawaare maaqqad garkk kiittintteez ta Phawuloosa, <verse eid="GAL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2"/>taar yez ammaniza ishitay ubbitaypp, Galatiya gade yeza woosa keethitayis kiittintteez kiita.<verse eid="GAL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3"/>Xooss nu Adaypp nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosapp yinttis aadho keehatithinnee sarotithii maaqqo.<verse eid="GAL 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4"/>Yha iita alamaypp nuna ashshodayis, nu Xoossayinnee nu Aday shener Kiristtoosa nu nagara gishos fana aathii inggeeza. <verse eid="GAL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5"/>Xoossayis Medhinapp medhina hellodayis bonchcho maaqqo. Amin7e.<verse eid="GAL 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuma Wonggilay petto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6"/>Kiristtoosa aadho keehatithar yinttan xeegeez Xoossa ashii, hara Wonggilayiko yi ellisii wayizii maaqqeezako taas malabaz maaqqeeza. <verse eid="GAL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7"/>Yinttan balithitarannee Kiristtoosa Wonggile wobbisodayis koyiz pettii pettii asitay yezapp attin tuma Wonggilay petto. <verse eid="GAL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8"/>Zin nuna maaqqin woy salo kiitanchcho maaqqin nuun yinttis tiina odeez Wonggilaypp dummatiza hara Wonggile yinttis odeezibaz maaqqiko, E cazhintteeza maaqqo. <verse eid="GAL 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9"/>Yhaypp tiina taanii geezay garkk yhattekka mahii giza. Yi ekkeez Wonggilaypp dummattiza Wonggile oonkka yinttis odiko ye athay cazhinteeza maaqqo.<verse eid="GAL 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10"/>Yeezin, tana asii nashichod garkk koyinenee? Xoossii nashichod garkke? Ta as ufayssodaysonee? Ta as ufayssodayis koyiz baz maaqqiko, Kiristtoosa aylle maaqqaamizin.<verse eid="GAL 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa hawaretethis xeegintteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11"/>Ta ishuntho, ta yinttis odeez Wonggilay asapp hanekkaza yi erod garkk ta koyiza. <verse eid="GAL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12"/>Taass yha wongila Yesuus Kiristtoosa dooyeezapp attin asapp ekkekkaya woy asii tana tamaarssekkaya.<verse eid="GAL 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13"/>Ta tiina Ayihuditay ammanayid yez wode wayizii yezeezako, yi si7eeza. Ta Xoossa woosa keeth bayi7odayisnnee dhabisodayis butiteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Haw. O. 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4-5">22:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14"/>Ayihuditay ammana naagor taanii, ta wodayid yez gaame Ayihude dabbitaypp aadhiza. Nu aditay wogayiskka ubbapp aathii micinttiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:3">Haw. O. 22:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15"/>Zin ta haga yelinttodaypp tiina Xoossay tana dooreeza; fa aadho keehatithara tana xeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:3-6">Haw. O. 9:3-6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-10">22:6-10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:13-18">26:13-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16"/>Ayihude baa asayis wonggile odod garkke Xoossay fa Na7a taass qonccisodayis koyeez wode ta oorakka zorinttekkaya. <verse eid="GAL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17"/>Woy taapp tiina hawaare maaqqeezitayir woli hellodayis Yerusalaame yhanigekkaya. Zin ta tiinatii Arabe biitta yhanigeeza; yeypp maaqqii Damasqqo katama ye7eeza. <verse eid="GAL 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18"/>Haaydzii laythapp guye, Keefa ginttiz phixiroosa hellodayis Yerusalaame yhanigii ezar wola taphpho ichchin qamma betteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:26-30">Haw. O. 9:26-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19"/>Zin Goday isha Yayqqoobapp attin yhankko hawaarita ta be7ekkaya.<verse eid="GAL 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20"/>Ta yinttis xaafizay worddo baazana Xooss tiina yinttis odiza.<verse eid="GAL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21"/>Yeypp guye, taanii Soora biittannee Kilqqa biitta yhanigeeza. <verse eid="GAL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22"/>Yihuda gancce yez woosa keeth asay tana bi7ii erekkaya. <verse eid="GAL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23"/>Zin unttii, «Kase nuna bayi7ithiz athay, yhatti E dhabisodayis koyiz ammanay bagga sabbakiza» yeegizana si7eeza. <verse eid="GAL 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24"/>Si7eez ubbay ta baggas Xoossa galatteeza.<verse eid="GAL 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa hawaaretithay erintteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1"/>Taphpho oyddii laythapp guye, Barnnabaasar maaqqii Yerusalaame ta yhanigeeza. Ye wode Titona ta taar ekkii yhanigeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:30">Haw. O. 11:30</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:2">15:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2"/>Xoossay taas qoncciseez qonccithayir ezayid yhanigii Ayihude baa as gancce ta sabbakiza wonggila unttis qoncce kesseeza. Tiina ta woxxeez wothaynnee yhattekka ta woxxiza wothay cere maaqqaam garkk gi kaalithizita duma shiishii unttis odeeza. <verse eid="GAL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3"/>Hara attozin, taar yez Tito Girkke as maaqqikokka, dookalintto gi eza ciiphichekkaya. <verse eid="GAL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4"/>Maaqqozin, ammaniza ishita aazii nu gancce geleez pettay pettay E dookalinttod garkk koyeeza. Ye asitay Kiristtoos Yesuusar nuuss yezi wallotitha bonqqii ekkodayis zurqqinttii nu gancce gelii mahii nuna ayllithodayis koyiza. <verse eid="GAL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5"/>Zin tuma Wonggilay yinttar miinggii yezod garkk nuunii hara attozin, xiqqa wodeskka unttis kushe inggekkaya.<verse eid="GAL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6"/>Zin aqisizita aaziz asay oonatithay taas abikka maaqqekkaya. Xoossii as aafe bi7ii pirddooya. Yha asitay ta markkattiz Wonggilayil afa gujjeez baz baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Nam7i. 10:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7"/>Zin Phixiroosa, Ayihuditayis Wonggile odo gi Xoossay ezis hadara inggeezay garkk taaskka Ayihude baa asayis Wonggile odod hadara inggeezana unttii guyepp ereeza. <verse eid="GAL 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8"/>Yikkee, Phixiroosa Ayihuditay hawaare maaqqaday garkk ootheez Xoossay, tanakka Ayihude baa asayis hawaare maheeza. <verse eid="GAL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9"/>Ma tuuss aazii benttiz Yayqqooba, Phixiroosannee Waanisa, taasi inggintteez aadho keehetitha bi7ii nuur maadinttodayis taasinnee Barnnabaasas fa ushach kushayid inggeeza. Nuunii Ayihude baa asayiko, ma unttikka Ayihude asitayiko yhammadayis ma7intteeza. <verse eid="GAL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10"/>U nuna miinthii hadara geezay, nuunii manqqitayis qoppodana. Kasekka ta yeya oothodayis ammottizayisii.<verse eid="GAL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Phixiroosa hana ixxeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11"/>Phixiroosa Anxooka katama yhanigii balintteez gishos taanii e tiina «Neenii balintteeza» gi gayileeza. <verse eid="GAL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12"/>Yayqqooba kiittii dakkeez xiqqa asay ye7odaypp tiina E Ayihude baa asitayir wolla miiza, Zin unttii ye7eezaypp guye, «Ayihude baa asaypp ammaneezitay dookalinttodayss beeziza» giz asayis yashittii unttapp shaakintteeza. <verse eid="GAL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13"/>Ma yhankko ammaneez Ayihuditay Phixiroosa hana kaalleeza. Hara attozin, Barnnabaasakka e qofayid geleeza.<verse eid="GAL 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14"/>Zin unttii Wonggile tumatithar luule yedhdhozana ta bi7ii, Phixiroosana as ubbitay tiina, «Neenii Ayihude maaqqittar, Ayihude wogay garkk baazin Ayihude baa as garkk yeziza; yeezin, wayizii Ayihude baazitayiskka, Ayihude wogayid yezoytta gi ne wolqqatee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="GAL 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15"/>Nuunii yelintto Ayihude, Zin nagara oothiz Ayihude baa as garkk baaya. <verse eid="GAL 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16"/>Zin asii Yesuus Kiristtoosa ammanii xillizapp attin higge naagii xilloozana nu eriza. Oonkka higge naagii xillowa gishos nuukka higge naagor baazin Kiristtoosa ammanii xillod garkk Kiristtoos Yesuusana ammaneeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 143:2">Maz. 143:2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:20">Oro. 3:20</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 3:22">22</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17"/>Kiristtoosa baggar xillodayis koyttar, nuukka nagara oothiza maaqqii benttiko Yeezin, nu nagara oothod garkk denthithizay Kiristtoosa guussonnee? Wa77a! <verse eid="GAL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18"/>Yikkee, ta laaleezana higge woga mahii keexxiza maaqqiko taanii ta ubbas higge menthiza maaqqeezana beeziza. <verse eid="GAL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19"/>Taanii Xoossis path yezoday garkk higge baggar higges yhayqqeeza. <verse eid="GAL 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20"/>Taanii Kiristtoosar wolla sottintteeza. Taanii yhayppe gede taasi yezaamii, zin Kiristtoosa taar yeza. Ta yhatti yez yessa, tana qadhdhii ta gishos fana aathii inggeez Xooss Na7a ammanii yeza. <verse eid="GAL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21"/>Taanii Xooss aadho keehetitha cere udaamii. Xillotithii asis higge baggar benttiz baz maaqqeezako, Kiristtoosa cer yhayqqeez guussii.<verse eid="GAL 2:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Xillotithii benttizay ammanora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1"/>Yinttano, akaaka baa Galaatiya asitayyo, yi aafay tiinayid Kiristtoosa mazqqalel afa sotintteez garkk misilinttii pidhdhe benttiza. Yeezin, tumas yi kiitinttaamay garkk yinttan biteezay oonoo?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:26">Nam7i. 27:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2"/>Pettii baz erodayis ta koyiza; yi Geeshsha Ayyana ekkeezay higge naagorannee woy yi si7eez Wonggila ammanora? <verse eid="GAL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3"/>Yi yhay garkk boozoo? Yi Xoossa Ayyanar aykkii, yhatti ashor polodayis koyinee? <verse eid="GAL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4"/>Yi Wonggile baggar gaame daabureezay ceree? Ye meto ubbay cere maaqqaree? <verse eid="GAL 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5"/>Xoossay yinttis Geeshsha Ayyana inggizaynnee yi gancce malla baz oothizay, yi higge naageezay gishonnee? Wonggile si7ii ammaneez gishoso?<verse eid="GAL 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6"/>An Afraamena bo7oytta, «E Xoossana ammaneeza; Xoossay ezis yeya xillotithi mahii tayibeeza» yeeginttii xaafintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Medhe. 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:3">Oro. 4:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7"/>Yikkee, ammanizitay Afraame na7ita maaqqizana eroytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:16">Oro. 4:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8"/>Xoossay Ayihude baa as ammanor xillithodana Geeshsha Maxaafay tiina bi7ii, «Woya ubbay ne baggar anjjinttoda» yeegii, Mishiraachcho Qaala Afraames tiinattii odeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Medhe. 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9"/>Yey gishos, ammaniza ubbay ammaneez Afraamer wolla anjjintteeza.<verse eid="GAL 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10"/>Higge naagii xillod giz oonkka cazhintteeza. Abis giiko, Geeshsha Maxaafayid, «Higge maxaafay gancce xaafintteez ubba naagoowa oonkka cazhintteeza maaqqo» ginttinttii xaafintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:26">Nam7i. 27:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11"/>«Xillo as ammanor yezoda» ginttinttii xaafintteez gishos oonkka Xooss tiina higge naagii xilloozay erintteez bazi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:4">Ibr. 2:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12"/>Higge ammanor wolla yhanigooya. Zin, «Higge higger yezodayis danda7izay higge azazo ubba poliko» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lewii. 18:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13"/>«Mithal afa sotinttii yhayqqiz oonkka cazhintteeza» ginttinttii xaafintteez gishos Kiristtoosa nu gishos cazhintteeza maaqqii, nuna higge cashshapp wozeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">Nam7i. 21:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14"/>Xoossay Afraames inggeez anjjo, Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggar Ayihude baa as hellodgarkkennee Xoossay immad geez Geeshsha Ayyana nuunii ammanor ekkodgarkk yeya ootheeza.<verse eid="GAL 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Higgennee ufayis qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15"/>Ta ishuntho, ta yinttis as yessar gami7i yeza baz aaziso udii odiza. Asii caaqqeez caaqo qaalay minggeezaypp guye, oonkka ye caaqo qaala shaarodayis woy ezal afa hara gujjodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="GAL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16"/>Xoossay ye ufayis qaala Afraamesinnee e sheeshayis inggeeza. Geeshsha Maxaafay, gaame asis odizaygarkk, «Ne sheeshitayis» gooya. Zin pettii asis odizay garkk, «Ne sheeshayis» yeegiza; ezkka Kiristtoosa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Medhe. 12:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17"/>Taanii gizay yhaya; oyddii xeetannee hasttam laythapp guye inggintteez higgay, tiina Xoossay mintheez caaqo qaala shaarii ufayssi qaala dhabisodayis danda7ooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:40">Kes. 12:40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18"/>Xoossay inggiz laatay higger ekinttizabaz maaqqeezako Xoossay inggeez ufayssay baggar maaqqizay attiza. Zin Xoossay fa aadho keehatithar laata Afraames ufayss qaala baggar inggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:14">Oro. 4:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Higge abis inggintteezako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19"/>Yeezin, higgay abis ingginttenee? Higge inggntteezay, Afraames ufayss qaala inggintteez zerithay ye7od gatho iita ooso abizako ersodayssii. Higge kiitanchchitay baggar ingginttii, gancce maaqqii dabbothiza pettii as baggar oosol afa peezheeza. <verse eid="GAL 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20"/>Gancce maaqqii dabbothiza athay pettii bagga aaddapp baaya, zin Xoossay petto.<verse eid="GAL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21"/>Yeezin, higgay Xooss ufayssi qaala ixxinennee? Ixxooya! Higge inggintteezay de7o immadayis maaqqeezako, xillotithii higge baggar benttodazin. <verse eid="GAL 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22"/>Zin Yesuus Kiristtoosa ammanin benttiz ufayssi qaalay ammanizitayis ingginttod garkk alamay kunthay nagara achcha yezana Geeshsha Maxaafay odiza.<verse eid="GAL 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23"/>Zin ammano ye7odaypp tiina higge nuna accii gaddeeza. Ye ammanay benttod gatho higgay nuul afa gorddii gaddeeza. <verse eid="GAL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24"/>Yey gishos, nuunii ammanor xillod garkk Kiristtoosa ye7od gatho higgay na7a naagiz as garkk nuna naagiza maaqqeeza. <verse eid="GAL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25"/>Zin yhatte ammano ye7eez gishos higge yhaypp guye na7a naagiz as garkk maaqqeez higgay oommor aqith atteeza.<verse eid="GAL 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26"/>Yi ubbitay Yesuus Kiristtoosana ammanii Xooss na7ita maaqqeeza. <verse eid="GAL 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27"/>Kiristtoosar petto maaqqodayis xammaqqintteez ubbitay Kiristtoosana afila garkk ma7eeza. <verse eid="GAL 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28"/>Yi ubbitay Kiristtoosar petto maaqqeez gishos Ayihude as ganccennee Girike as gancce, aylle ganccennee womaanno gancce, dhiirathi ganccennee maachchi gancce dummatithii baaya. <verse eid="GAL 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29"/>Yikkee, yi Kiristtoosas maaqqiko yi Afraame kochchii. Xooss ufayis qaalay garkk yi laattizita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:13">Oro. 4:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1"/>Yhattekka ta gizay yhaya. Laattiza na7ay duudetitha yeza wode, shalo ubbay ebaz maaqqikokka, E ayllepp abarakka dummatooya. <verse eid="GAL 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2"/>Zin e aday geez woday hellodayis E hadara ekkeezitay kushennee naagizitay kushe yeziza. <verse eid="GAL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3"/>Yey garkk, nuunii Ayyana bazis duude maaqqii yez wode alame wogas aylliteeza. <verse eid="GAL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4"/>Zin woday hellin Xoossay maachchapp yelintteez fa na7ana azazeeza. Ezikka higges azazintteezaya maaqqeeza. <verse eid="GAL 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5"/>E yeya ootheezay, higges haarinttii yezita wozodayisnnee nuna fa na7ita oothodayisii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:15-17">Oro. 8:15-17</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6"/>Nu Xooss na7ita maaqqeez gishos «Aabbo, ta adayyo» yeegii xeegiz fa Na7ay Ayyana nu wozina gancce kiiteeza. <verse eid="GAL 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7"/>Yey gishos, yhaypp neenii Xooss na7app attin aylle baaya. Neenii e na7a maaqqiko, Xoossa laattiza as maaqqiza.<verse eid="GAL 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Galatiya asayis qoppiza qofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8"/>Yi tiina Xooss eroowa wode Xooss baazitayis aylle maaqqii haarintteeza. <verse eid="GAL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9"/>Zin yhatt yi Xooss ereeza; ubbarakka Xoossar erintteeza. Yeezin pathozayikonnee maaddoowa alame wogitayiko guye wayizii maaqqee? Wodhdhii eqqii, wayizii unttis aylle maaqqodayis koyee? <verse eid="GAL 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10"/>Duma maaqqeez gallasita, aginita, woditannee laythita yi lo7ithii bonchchiza. <verse eid="GAL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11"/>Ta yi gancce yinttis daabureezay cere attodeshsha gi ta yashshiteeza.<verse eid="GAL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12"/>Ta ishuntho, ta yi garkk haneez gishos yinttikka ta garkk hanoytta gi yinttan woossiza. Yi tana abarakka qohekkaya. <verse eid="GAL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13"/>Taanii tiina hargginttittar yinttis Wonggile odeezana yi eriza. <verse eid="GAL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14"/>Ta harggay yinttis paace maaqqikokka, yi tana salinttekkaya; ixxekkaya. Zin tana Xooss kiitanchcho woy Kiristtoos Yesuusa mokkizay garkk mokkeeza.<verse eid="GAL 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15"/>Yeezin, ye yinttis yeza ufayssay ubbay ana yhanigeenee? Yinttis danda7intteezako, yi yi aafa kessii taas inggizako ixxaamizana ta markkattiza. <verse eid="GAL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16"/>Yeezin, ta yinttis tuma odeez gishos yinttis morkke maaqqarennee?<verse eid="GAL 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17"/>Ye asay yinttan faako mahodayis koyiza, Zin u qofay lo77os baaya. U qofay yinttan shagodayisnnee yi unttis qoppod garkk oothodayisii. <verse eid="GAL 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18"/>Lo77o baz oothodayis amotiko lo77o, Zin yey ta yinttar yez wode aadda baazin ubba wode maaqqo.<verse eid="GAL 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19"/>Ta siiqo na7untho, Kiristtoosa yinttal misilinttod gatho yelos maachchii iqinttizay garkk ta yi gisho maakka iqinttiza. <verse eid="GAL 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20"/>Kaseesaypp ta qofa laammodayis koyeezazin taas erinttaam ixxin ta mettintteeza.<verse eid="GAL 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aggaarinnee Saara aaziso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21"/>Higges haarinttii yezodayis koyizitayyo, an taas odoytta; higgay waagizako yi eroosa? <verse eid="GAL 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay, «Afraames gadhinddattippennee godattatipp yelintteez nam7i na7itay yeza» yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:15">Medhe. 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23"/>Gadhinddattii na7ay as na7a yelinttizay garkk yelintteeza, zin godattatii na7ay Xooss ufayssa qaalar yelintteeza.<verse eid="GAL 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24"/>Yha maachchitay nam77ii caaqitayis aaziso maaqqii ekinttiza. Unttapp pettat, Siinna Derellappe ye7eezanna, fa na7ita aylletithis yeleeza; izakka Aggaaro. <verse eid="GAL 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25"/>Aggaara Arabe biittal yez Siinna Derer aazisinttii yhatti yez Yerusalaame aaziza. Abis giiko, iza fa na7itayira aylletitha yeza. <verse eid="GAL 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26"/>Zin salopp maaqqeez Yerusalaame aylletithar yezooya; iza nuus ubbayis indo. <verse eid="GAL 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27"/>Xillo Maxaafay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">«Bushitte, yelekka dhonthatee ufayttoba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">bushitte iqintti erozannee ilisoba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Azinar yez maachchatipp,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">azinii baa maachchatis na7itay gaame» yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Isa. 54:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28"/>Ta ishuntho, yi Isaaqa garkk Xooss ufayss qaalar yelintteez na7ita. <verse eid="GAL 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29"/>Zin ye wode as wogar yelinttodayisi, Ayyana wolqqar yelintteezana bayi7eeza. Yhayinokka yey garkke.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:9">Medhe. 21:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30"/>Zin Geeshsha Maxaafay waagee? «Gadhinddattii na7ay godattatii na7ayira wolla laattoowa gisho gadhindato I na7ayira wolla kessii dakkoba» yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:10">Medhe. 21:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31"/>Yey gisho, ta ishuntho, nuunii godattatii na7itaypp attin gadhindattii na7ita baaya.<verse eid="GAL 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosar yez wallotith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1"/>Nuunii walottithar yezoday garkk Kiristtoosa nuna aylletithapp kesseeza. Yikkee, miinggii eqqoytta; maaqqii aylletith qambbarayid gelippate.<verse eid="GAL 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2"/>Ta, Phawuloosa, giza si7oytta. Yi «Dookalintto maaddiza» gi yi dookalinttodayis koyko, Kiristtoosa yinttan abikka maaddooya. <verse eid="GAL 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3"/>Dookalinttiza oonkka higgay kiittiza ubbita polodayis beezizana mahii ta odiza. <verse eid="GAL 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4"/>Higge naagii xillodayis koyizitay, Kiristtoosapp shaakintteeza; Xooss aadho keehatithaypp yi haakkeeza. <verse eid="GAL 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5"/>Zin nuunii Xooss Ayyana baggar ammanor xillodayis ufayisar naagiza. <verse eid="GAL 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6"/>Yikkee, Kiristtoos Yesuusar yeziko, siiqor benttiz ammanopp attin dookalinttin, dookalinttekka attin nuna abkka maaddooya.<verse eid="GAL 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7"/>Tiina yi lo77o woxxiza, zin yhatti tumas azazinttaamay garkk yinttan kayeezay oonoo? <verse eid="GAL 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8"/>Yhay garkk iita dooshay yinttan xeegeez Xoossaypp ye7ekkaya. <verse eid="GAL 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9"/>Yeykka, «Xiqqa irshsho munuqo ubba denthiza» ginttinttii xaafintteezay garkk.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:6">1 Qor. 5:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10"/>Yinttis hara qofa baazayisi ta Godayil ammaninttiza. Zin yinttan buqiz oonkka Xoossapp fa pirdda ekkoda.<verse eid="GAL 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11"/>Ta ishuntho, ta yhaya hellodayis dookalintto sabbakkizabaz maaqqiko, yeezin tana abis bayi7ee? Yey tuma maaqqeezako Kiristtoosa mazqalay bagga tamaarssay asis dhube maaqqaamizin. <verse eid="GAL 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12"/>Yinttan buqizitay fana dookalith aadda baazin fana qaaratizakokka ta dosiza.<verse eid="GAL 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13"/>Ta ishuntho, yi wallo yezodayis xeegintteeza. Maaqqozin, yi wallotithay asho amotith polodayis yinttis sankke maaqqippe; yeypp aathii pettay petta siiqor maaddoytta. <verse eid="GAL 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14"/>Higge ubbay, «Ase ne ubbay garkk qadhdhoba» yeegiz pettii qaalar accinttiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lewii. 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15"/>Zin yi pettay pettayir saxinttizbazinnee miinttinttizbaz maaqqiko, yi woli wurssaamay garkk naaginttoytta.<verse eid="GAL 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayyana yessinnee asho yess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16"/>Yikkee, ta yinttis odiza; Ayyanar yezoytta; yi asho amo yesha polippate. <verse eid="GAL 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17"/>Asho amo Ayaana amor morkke; ma Ayyana amaykka asho amora morkke. Unttii pettay pettayir ixinttiza gishos yi dosizabaz oothodayis danda7ooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:15-23">Oro. 7:15-23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18"/>Zin Ayyanay yinttan kaalithiza baz maaqqiko higge yinttan haarooya.<verse eid="GAL 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19"/>Asho oositay erintteezita; unttikka, lagite, tuna ootho, qayixe, <verse eid="GAL 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20"/>eeqas goynno, bita, morkkintto, kachchii, qinaate, cashshii, fana dosithii, shaakintto, iita tobba <verse eid="GAL 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21"/>gene, mathe, yethinnee yeyitita aazizita. Tiina ta yinttis odeezay garkk yhattekka ta yinttis odiza. Yhay garkk bazita oothizitay Xooss kaatetithii laattooya.<verse eid="GAL 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22"/>Zin Ayyana aafe, siiqo, ufayssii, sarotithii, minthatho, haayotithii, lo77otithii, ammano, <verse eid="GAL 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23"/>ashikketithii, fana haaro. Yhay garkk bazita ixxiza higge baaya.<verse eid="GAL 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24"/>Kiristtoosa Yesuusas maaqqeezitay fa asho e iita qofayirannee e amayira wolla mazqalel afa sotteeza. <verse eid="GAL 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25"/>Nu Ayyanar yeza baz maaqqiko, nuna Ayyanay kaalitho. <verse eid="GAL 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26"/>An pettay petta yilosittarannee qinaatittar cer ceeqinttitha wolla ashshoda.<verse eid="GAL 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Wolla maaddinttoytta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1"/>Ta ishuntho, asii balinttii buuta baz oothiko, Ayyanar yez yi ye atha ashikketithar luulisoytta. Zin neenii yey garkke bazar paacinttaam garkk nena naagoba. <verse eid="GAL 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2"/>Pettay yhankay deexo toofa tookkoo, yeeziko Kiristtoosa higga yi poliza. <verse eid="GAL 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3"/>Pettii asii akkokka baazin, fana yhankkitaypp lo77o gi qopiko, E fana dooshiza. <verse eid="GAL 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4"/>Zin pettii pettii asii fa oosa faacco. Yeyppi guye, hara asar fana qeelithiza ashshii paas ceeqinttiza baz denggiza. <verse eid="GAL 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5"/>Pettii pettii asii fa toofo paas tookkodayis beeziza.<verse eid="GAL 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6"/>Xooss qaala tamaariza oonkka lo77o baz ubba fa asitamaarayira gishinttiza.<verse eid="GAL 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7"/>Yi, yinttan balithipatte. Asii fa zereezanno mahii maxiza gisho Xoossa dooshipatte. <verse eid="GAL 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8"/>Fa asho amo kunthodayisi zeriz oonkka, fa asho innapp yhayiqo maxoda. Zin Ayyana ufayssodayis zeriz oonkka Ayyanapp medhina de7o maxoda. <verse eid="GAL 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9"/>An lo77o ooso oothodayis azallizana wolla ashshoda. Nuunii azallam ixxiko woday helleez wode nu zereezana maxoda. <verse eid="GAL 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10"/>Nu giiga wode denggiko, as ubbayis, aathikka ammaniza asis lo77o baz oothoda.<verse eid="GAL 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssith zorennee sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11"/>Taanii ta kushayir, ab garkk damma pidaaler yinttis xaafeezako bo7oytta. <verse eid="GAL 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12"/>As tiina lo77o maaqqii benttodayis koyiz asay yi dookalinttod garkk koyiza. Zin yeya unttii oothizay, Kiristtoosa maziqale gisho unttan bayi7ithii hellaamay garkke. <verse eid="GAL 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13"/>Unttii yi dookalinttayir ceeqinttodayis koyii yinttan dookalintto gizapp attin dookalintteezitaykka fa ubbas higge naagooya.<verse eid="GAL 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14"/>Zin nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa mazqalaypp attin hara alamay taas sotintteezaynnee taankka alamayis sotintteez ceeqinttay taapp haakko. <verse eid="GAL 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15"/>Yikkee, dookalinttin dookalinttekka attin abikka maaddooya. Maaddizay Yesuus Kiristtoosar orothi medhetithii maaqqithii. <verse eid="GAL 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16"/>Yha woga kaalliza ubbitayisinnee Xoossis woya maaqqeez Isra7eeles sarotithinnee maarotithii maaqqo.<verse eid="GAL 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17"/>Taanii Yesuusas shocintteez ta ashayil yez beetay ta Yesuusas aylle maaqqeezana beeziza gisho yhaypp gede tana oonkka waaythippe.<verse eid="GAL 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18"/>Ta ishuntho, nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatithay yinttar maaqqo. Amin7e.<verse eid="GAL 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6"/>
</usx>
